<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='15565650107913932289'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">AAIEE 2027: 2027 IEEE 3rd International Symposium on the Application of Artificial Intelligence in Electrical Engineering</div><div id="cfpvenue"></div><div id="cfpdateplace">Guangzhou, China, April 23-26, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.aaiee.net/" target="_blank">https://www.aaiee.net/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=aaiee2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=aaiee2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 30, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=670" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkgreen bg_palegoldenrod">artificial intelligence</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=35679248" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_blue bg_green">intelligent grid operation</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=44212476" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_haki">uav intelligent inspection</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=44212477" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_wheat">optimize insulation design</span></a></div><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">It is a great pleasure for us to invite you all to participate as speaker, delegate, sponsor at the 2027 IEEE 3rd International Symposium on the Application of Artificial Intelligence in Electrical Engineering (AAIEE), which will take place from April 23-26, 2027, in Guangzhou, China. It's sponsored by South China University of Technology, hosted by School of Electric Power Engineering, South China University of Technology, patrons with China Agricultural University, Global Chinese Power &amp; Energy Society, etc.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">This conference will explore the transformative role of AI technologies like Chat GPT in revolutionizing in Electrical Engineering. We seek cutting-edge papers on AI applications in power systems, agricultural energy, high-voltage technologies, power electronics, digital grid construction, and smart grid operation. It is to provide a unique forum for discussion of the latest developments, refresh your knowledge and will offer plenty of networking opportunities, providing you a chance to meet and interact with leading researchers as well as most influential minds in the field of application of artificial intelligence in electrical engineering.</span></span></p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Reviewing Process</span></span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">The conference committee's selection panel will review all papers or abstracts received by the submission deadline to ensure relevance to the symposium.</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">All papers and abstracts will undergo double-blind peer review by committee members to guarantee an adequate standard, adherence to the proposed subject, suitable length, satisfactory English quality, and proper referencing.</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">The evaluation of papers will be based on scientific merit, technical quality, relevance to the conference scope, originality, significance, and clarity.</span></span></li></ul><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Receiving Notification</span></span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">If the paper does not align with the topics or is deemed unqualified, a rejection email will be sent.</span></span></li></ul><ul><li><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">After the paper passes two rounds of the reviewing process, a formal acceptance letter will be mailed, including the review form with comments, etc. Please carefully re-edit and improve the paper quality according to the review comments.</span></span></li></ul><h2>List of Topics</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Topics for submission include, but are not limited to:</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 1: Artificial Intelligence in Power Systems</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 2: Artificial Intelligence in Clean Energy Power Generation</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 3: Artificial Intelligence in High Voltage and Insulation Technology</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 4: Artificial Intelligence Technology Assists in the Construction of Digital Power Grids</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 5: Intelligent Grid Operation and Maintenance Monitoring Based on Artificial Intelligence</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Track 6: Artificial Intelligence in the Electricity Market</span></span></p><h2>Committees</h2><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">General Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jiehui Zheng, South China University of Technology, China (IEEE IAS Member)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xueqian Fu, China Agricultural University, China (IEEE IAS Member)</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">General Co-chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Bin Zhou, Hunan University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hao Xiao, Institute of Electrical Engineering of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, China (IEEE PES Executive Director of the Power Grid Operation and Control Subcommittee)</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Organization Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yue Zhou, Tianjin University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tianguang Lv, Shandong University, China (IEEE IAS Member)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Zhenyuan Zhang, University of Electronic Science and Technology of China, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Shiqian Ma, State Grid Tianjin Electric Power Company, China (Secretary General of IEEE IAS Distributed Energy Technologies Committee)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Youbo Liu, Sichuan University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yushu Sun, Institute of Electrical Engineering of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, China (Vice Secretary General of IEEE PES Energy Storage Technology Committee (China)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Weiqi Hua, University of Birmingham, UK</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Siqi Wang, Institute of Electrical Engineering of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xin Zhang, University of Sheffield, UK (IEEE IAS Senior Member, Associate Editor - IEEE Transactions on Smart Grid (TSG))</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Program Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hongjian Sun, Durham University, UK</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Yujian Ye, Southeast University, China (Chairman of IEEE Systems, Man, and Cybernetics Society – Nanjing Chapter)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xisheng Tang, Institute of Electrical Engineering of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">(Director of IEEE PES Power, Information and Communications AI Technologies Committee)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Jiancheng Yu, State Grid Tianjin Electric Power Company, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiaodong Yuan, State Grid JiangSu Electric Power Company, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiaojun Wang, Beijing Jiaotong University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mustapha Kchikach, National School of Mines of Morocco, Morocco</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Teng Li, Beijing Jiaotong University, China</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Guoqiang Zhang, Harbin Institute of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">African Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Pascal Dieu Seul Assala, University of Douala, Cameroon</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Egypt Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mazen Abdel-Salam, Assiut University, Egypt</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">European Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Zhengmao Li, Aalto University, Finland</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">North America Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Youmin Zhang, Concordia University, Canada (IEEE Fellow, CSME Fellow)</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Hong Kong Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Zipeng Liang, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Africa Committee Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Pascal Dieu Seul Assala, University of Douala, Cameroon</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Award Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Liangzhong Yao, Wuhan University, China (IEEE Fellow)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Haoyong Chen, South China University of Technology, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Publication Chairs</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Zhaohao Ding, North China Electric Power University, China (Vice Chairman of IEEE IAS Energy System Committee)</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiurong Zhang, Beijing City University, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Student Program Chair</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Chen Zhang, China Agricultural University, China</span></span></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Local Committee</span></span></strong></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Xiaodong Zheng, South China University of Technology, China</span></span></p><h2>Publication</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Papers that are accepted and presented at AAIEE 2027 will be submitted for inclusion in conference proceedings, subject to main digital base.</span></span></p><h2>Contact</h2><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Dr. Ashily Qi</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Mail: aaiee@sciei.org</span></span></p><p><span style="font-size:16px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Tel: +86 19180921310</span></span></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
